$DIR/test.p:8:19: enum member A: value v (variable of type int) is not constant
    The value of an enum member must be a constant integer expression, such as
    5, 1 << 3 or another constant, since members are constants fixed when
    compiling.
    (see "Enums" in the Plutonium spec, section 7.12)
